7. Nxd4 $2 { Retakes with the knight, which looks natural. But it lets the knight trade off and leaves White a pawn down with nothing to show for it. } 7... Nge7 { Develops and keeps the extra pawn. Castle (7.O-O) or 7.Qb3 instead; the pieces then come out with tempo. } 8. O-O O-O 9. Qh5 d6 *
